# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are documented in this file.

This project follows a pragmatic versioning approach suitable for
client-grade static websites.

---

## [1.0.0] — Initial Production Release

### Added
- SEO-first static website structure
- Multi-page architecture under `/pages`
- Centralized assets directory (`/assets`)
- Apache `.htaccess` with cache and security considerations
- Architecture documentation under `/docs`
- Security policy documentation

### Changed
- Normalized asset paths (absolute references)
- Cleaned duplicated folders and unused files
- Standardized routing and internal linking

### Notes
- This release represents the first production-ready version
- Deployed to live environment and GitHub Pages preview
